# Regenerable build output — not source.
#
# The committed project is the *authored* half of ADR 0008's split: storyboard,
# script, design spec, compositions, fonts and narration. Everything below is
# produced mechanically from that by `docs-build:video` / the HyperFrames CLI,
# so it is rebuilt rather than tracked.
#
# Note: the repo root .gitignore ignores all dot-prefixed paths (`.*`), so this
# project's `.hyperframes/` working directory — the caption skin and the per-frame
# sub-agent dispatch packets — is already excluded and needs no rule here.

# Rendered video. The real deliverable lands outside this directory, at
# custom_addons/crm_methodology/static/docs/methodologies.mp4,
# written by `docs-build:video` via its --output flag.
renders/

# Review artifacts from `hyperframes snapshot` (contact sheets + PNG stills).
snapshots/

node_modules/
